# DTOs and AppResponse

Per feature, folder under `Challingo.Core/DTO/{Feature}Dto/`:

- `{Action}{Entity}Request` / `{Entity}Response`
- Static `{Feature}Mappers` class

Services return `AppResponse` / `AppResponse<T>` — not raw entities to controllers.
